\n- Camera\n- Towel\n- Sunscreen\n- Sweater or light jacket\n- Cash or card for Pink Sails Swag/tips\n\n##What *not* to Bring:\n- Snorkel gear (snorkeling is not allowed for safety)\n\n##Where to meet\nWe depart near the Prince Waikiki Hotel and Pau Hana Place. The address for departure is:\n\n1 Holomoana St,\nHonolulu, HI 96815\n\n*Please inform your Uber/Lyft drivers to take you here. We moved a few years ago and they often will take you to our old location, which is a 10-15 minute walk.*\n\n## Where to park\nStreet parking is available for $1 per hour. **Only park in white stalls, yellow stalls are permit only.** The tow company is very aggressive about towing. Please make sure you pay for enough time.\n\n#Important:\n- Must have basic swimming skills.", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "1 Holomoana St, Honolulu, HI 96815", "booking_notes": "", "cancellation_notes": "", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 45, "headline": "All Ages • 5 pm to Sunset • Inside & Outside Seating", "short_description": "", "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/pinksailswaikiki/items/80660/images/869912/", "pk": 869912, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/WaPrmA5bQ6fmobBauFww", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/WaPrmA5bQ6fmobBauFww", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/pinksailswaikiki/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/pinksailswaikiki/items/80660/"}, "crop": {"x": 0, "y": 0, "width": 2172, "height": 1143, "url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/BKnnnjiOSVCrQVuhMlKS"}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/BKnnnjiOSVCrQVuhMlKS", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/BKnnnjiOSVCrQVuhMlKS", "is_low_resolution": false, "has_text_overlay": false, "has_logo_overlay": false}, {"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/pinksailsw